    "created_at": "2023-03-16T02:21:10Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-03-16T02:21:10Z",
    "body": "Note that we previously got some consensus on 1 instead of 0 in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/6491, /cc @rakina. I think we got a good suite of web platform tests for that, too: https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/28541. However re-reviewing them I don't see any assertions on `history.length` immediately after opening the window, so maybe we should add those.\r\n\r\nOne route here is to just change the history length to default to 1, which might require updating fewer call sites. (I.e. we'd only need to update in the iframe case, I think.)",
