    "created_at": "2023-05-23T14:01:19Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-05-23T14:01:19Z",
    "body": "I think the behavior in Firefox comes from the fact that window.open(); (no arguments) doesn't load anything, it just creates the initial about:blank. window.open(\"about:blank\"); behaves differently, because it loads a document. @hsivonen is making some changes to about:blank handling, but I can't recall now if the changes will affect window.open() too.",
